["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/analysis", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Analytical evaluating of data, designs, or processes methodically to verify correctness against standards or expectations. Typical analysis methods are FMEA, FTA, STPA, static analysis for MISRA compliance etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasAssessmentFor", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Relates a `from` Vulnerability and each `to` Element with a security assessment. To be used with `VulnAssessmentRelationship` types.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
